	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "1badad0d-af74-4394-b484-53e1b386fe04",
		"name": "Againgency API",
		"description": "API Introduction\n\nThis API is an interface allowing external applications to communicate with Againgency based on a unified abstract interface.  \nThis interface detaches the concept from a physical database structure and provides additional business logic and security when accessing the data.\n\nIntended audience\n\nThis document is intended to the third party software vendors who are developing a system which needs connectivity to Againgency.  \nThis document is intended for distribution to all vendors and developers of hospitality software systems.  \nThe data contained herein is public information and is published for public use.\n\nSystem Overview\n\nProvided functions.  \nThe API provides the following functionality:  \n• Order lookup  \n• Order update  \n• Order creation  \n• Payment lookup  \n• Payment update  \n• Payment creation  \n• Tender lookup  \n• Tender creation  \n• Transaction lookup  \n• Property lookup  \n• User lookup\n\nFields available for selection by request type  \nSpecification for Againgency Common API available on [https://api.againgency.com/docs](https://api.againgency.com/docs)\n\nAPI key can be generated from [https://deck.againgency.com/settings#integration](https://deck.againgency.com/settings#integration)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "15690166"
	},
